        },
        "fields": {
          "notes": "Peer-reviewed CDLB research Work published 2003-02-24. The live HTML reports version 2003-02-24 and the publisher PDF version 2003-02-25. It argues from orientation-bearing objects and pisan-dub-ba attachment morphology toward a later cuneiform direction change. Its decisive tag evidence comes from Ur III and Old Babylonian comparative material; application to Late Uruk requires separate evidence."
        },
